# Nothing is left sounding (NoteRegistry.flushEvents): a stop, a mute, a template switch and the arranger's ending,
# each while Ambient drift's drone holds its two notes (E3 52 0x34 and A3 57 0x39 on channel 1, 0 on the wire, each
# struck every 8 bars for 8 bars): a note-off for each, then All Notes Off (CC 123) on the channel. 72 BPM: a bar
# is 3333 ms; tick 0 sounds 100 ms after PLAY is seen (the press's first ms); bar N is tick N x 3840.
rt load ambient
# stop at bar 20 (the drone struck on bar 16): MIDI Stop, the offs, CC 123
tap PLAY
wait 66800
expect playing 1
expect tick 76929
expect sounding0 2
out
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect_out USB FC 00 00
expect_out USB 80 34 00
expect_out USB 80 39 00
expect_out USB B0 7B 00
expect sounding 0
expect queued 0
# mute in bar 4 (the drone struck on bar 0): its channel silenced at once; nothing of it on bars 8 to 15; unmuted
# in bar 13, it is struck again on bar 16
tap PLAY
wait 13400
expect tick 15412
expect sounding0 2
out
rt mute drone 1
expect_out USB 80 34 00
expect_out USB 80 39 00
expect_out USB B0 7B 00
expect sounding0 0
wait 30000
expect tick 49972
expect sounding0 0
rt mute drone 0
wait 20000
expect tick 73012
expect sounding0 2
# a template switch in bar 20 (tick 78772): on the next bar line (bar 21, tick 80640) the Full ensemble takes over,
# the drone's notes silenced there, its tempo (96 BPM) from that line on
wait 5000
expect tick 78772
out
rt load full
wait 1000
expect tempo_tick -1
expect sounding0 2
wait 1000
expect tick 81222
expect tempo_tick 80640
expect tick_rate 1536
expect bpm 96
expect_out USB 80 34 00
expect_out USB 80 39 00
expect_out USB B0 7B 00
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
# the arranger's ending: Ambient drift's ambient plateau ends on bar 288 (tick 1105920, 960 s from tick 0); the
# transport stops there by itself, MIDI Stop and the flush
rt load ambient
tap PLAY
wait 959000
expect playing 1
out
wait 2000
expect playing 0
expect_out USB FC 00 00
expect sounding 0
expect queued 0
